&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What is The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cr7t8-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cr7t8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cr7t8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Are you looking to make a real impact and play a meaningful role in the growth of our company?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cr7t8-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f5pvh-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f5pvh-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f5pvh-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The Partner Solutions Architect (PSA) multiplies Elastic&#39;s technical reach through partners. An account SA wins one deal at a time. You build technical capability across a focused group of partners (SIs, resellers, MSSPs, cloud providers) so they can source pipeline, win deals, and deliver Elastic on their own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f5pvh-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e9142-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e9142-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e9142-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The role has three pillars: drive partner-sourced pipeline; multiply technical capacity and co-build repeatable solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e9142-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You will work a defined portfolio of managed partners, each with an agreed technical &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1g:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; plan, and be measured on outputs, partner sourced deals, committed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1i:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5s8c3-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; plans and published assets, not on activity volume but impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are currently considering candidates who are located in or within close proximity to the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;117&quot;&gt;Florida Panhandle&lt;/strong&gt; (including &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;146&quot;&gt;Pensacola&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;157&quot;&gt;Fort Walton Beach&lt;/strong&gt;, and neighboring communities). Candidates outside of this geographic area will not be considered for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dgrfs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Prior presales experience in the software sector is required for this role in the US Public Sector. It is a sales-aligned position that carries a partner-sourced pipeline target and candidates should plan for up to 30% travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5of2t-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5of2t-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5of2t-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5of2t-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;16ufv-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;16ufv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;16ufv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive growth with and through partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6j8fl-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6j8fl-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6j8fl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6j8fl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Generate approved partner deal registrations, jointly owned with Partner Managers for your territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;888m7-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;888m7-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;888m7-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Run partner-tailored sales playbooks on registered deals: qualify the deal shape, support intake and technical scoping, and help partners attach their own services, lifting average deal size.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8attt-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8attt-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8attt-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Accelerate partner-led opportunities, hands-on labs and proofs of concept, in collaboration with account AEs and SAs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4gi26-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4gi26-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4gi26-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Stays current on competitive dynamics and market trends, equipping partners with sharp &quot;Why Elastic&quot; positioning over competing vendors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;754o8-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;754o8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;754o8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Architect of leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1nvuv-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1nvuv-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1nvuv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1nvuv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own the technical relationships and named champions at each partner in your portfolio; build trusted advisor status with senior technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Create, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1k:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;commit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; and maintain a Technical &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1m:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;16i5r-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Plan per focus partner, the technical section of the Joint Business Plan, and run quarterly read-outs with the partner, Partner Manager and other stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f102f-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f102f-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f102f-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deliver enablement and certification roadmaps, accreditations &amp;amp; certifications, that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1o:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f102f-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;move&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f102f-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; partners up a defined technical maturity model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7crr0-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7crr0-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7crr0-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Leads hands-on technical lab workshops across Elastic products, building partner technical confidence and solution fluency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9l4v-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9l4v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f9l4v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Co-innovate on repeatable solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4equ9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4equ9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4equ9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1q:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4equ9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Co-architect solution blueprints and reference architectures with partners, including hyperscalers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f7n8v-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f7n8v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f7n8v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build reusable demos, sales cards and battlecards partners can run without Elastic in the room; co-publish reference win stories and joint blog posts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cdo34-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cdo34-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cdo34-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Authors customer-facing content including white papers, blogs, and sales collateral, informed by market trends and deep relationships with partner technical leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;afsit-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;afsit-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;afsit-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Supports technical deployments of Elastic in partner labs, demonstration environments, and testing grounds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dv5si-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dv5si-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dv5si-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6pk8j-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6pk8j-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6pk8j-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1s:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6pk8j-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;2+ years e in technology solutions, practice development, architecture, consulting and/or cloud/infrastructure technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5qguf-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5qguf-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5qguf-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1u:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5qguf-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;practical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5qguf-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1rtjb-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1rtjb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1rtjb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;1+ years of pre-sales experience in the software sector, ideally partner-facing: channel, alliances, SI/GSI or MSSP ecosystems in the US Public Sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;3gb59&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a6437-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a6437-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a6437-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A one-to-many mindset: you would rather teach ten engineers to run the demo than run it ten times yourself, and you can show where your enablement turned into someone else&#39;s win.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
